 - Useful commands: `media-ctl -p`, `v4l2-ctl --list-devices`, `dmesg | grep -i imx585`, `lsmod | grep imx585`, `fdtget` (install via package if missing), `strace -eopenat,ioctl v4l2-ctl --list-devices` for ENAMETOOLONG errors.
